<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-17807] OutOfMemoryException in RebalanceIteratorLargeEntriesOOMTest on TC</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-17807</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/buildConfiguration/IgniteTests24Java8_Cache2/6801420?logFilter=debug&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/buildConfiguration/IgniteTests24Java8_Cache2/6801420?logFilter=debug&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The OOME exception seems to be thrown by the remote JVM, which is probably of version higher than 8 (probably 17, see &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-17805&quot; title=&quot;Fail a test if it tries to launch remote JVM with different major Java version&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-17805&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-17805&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The TC build contains a heap dump, but judging by its size (5.3Gb) and the configuration for the remove JVM (-Xmx256m), the dump is made on the original JVM that runs the test, so it is not relevant to the issue (as the OOME happens on the remote JVM).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
