                            <comment id="17619434" author="rpuch" created="Tue, 18 Oct 2022 10:24:11 +0000"  >&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;On my machine, 256Mb of heap is enough for the test to pass&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The test was passing with 256Mb on TC before TC migration&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The same test passes with 256Mb in Gridgain-CE (on different TC installation)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;So it seems that TC changes triggered failures, maybe due to slower disk subsystem: 256Mb is simply not enough.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So the proposed fix is to raise heap size to 512Mb.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
